<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: TABLE - CZECH UTILITY VCE H1 NET LOWER.</title>
<headline>TABLE - CZECH UTILITY VCE H1 NET LOWER.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1997-08-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results for six-month period</p>
<p>ending June 30, 1997: (in millions of crowns)</p>
<p> pre-tax profit		413.555	  333.360</p>
<p> after-tax profit	    335.014	  337.526</p>
<p> operating profit	    355.510	  326.775</p>
<p> depreciation		  280.685	  132.365</p>
<p>sales of own</p>
<p> goods/services	    8,104.847	4,131.316</p>
<p> sales of other goods	  5.439	    2.659</p>
<p> basic capital	     2,473.969	2,473.969</p>
<p> assets			7.474,703	7.070,128</p>
<p>Note. Full company name is Vychodoceska Energetika, an</p>
<p>energy distributor for the eastern Czech Republic. Results</p>
<p>filed with Prague Stock Exchange and provided by the bourse.</p>
<p>-- Prague Newsroom, 420-2-2423-0003</p>
</text>
